---
id: lem-qftx-nonabelian-brst-nilpotence
kind: lemma
title: Nilpotence of the Finite-Jet Non-Abelian BRST Differential
status: draft
origin: session
dependency_level: 1
domain: mathematics
library: mathematics
category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
deps:
  - def-qftx-nonabelian-brst-complex
