research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-batch-4-notes.md:25:- `def-qftx-nonabelian-brst-complex` (level 0; no item deps): defines the finite-jet algebra over a nonempty open coordinate patch, a finite-dimensional real Lie algebra and parity-preserving representation, and the left-odd convention `sA=∂c+[A,c]`, `sc=-1/2[c,c]`, `sψ=-ρ(c)ψ`. It claims no global bundle, action, or quantum theory. Sources: Barnich–Brandt–Henneaux (BHN), §§2.2–2.3 and 4.1–4.2; Gomis–París–Samuel (GPS), §§3.2 and 5.2.
